    {
      "text": "Lehi1 descendant of Joseph1, who was son of Jacob, 1 Ne. 5:14. God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, 1 Ne. 6:4 (19:10; Mosiah 7:19; 23:23; Alma 29:11; 36:2; 3 Ne. 4:30; Morm. 9:11). the Lord covenanted with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, 1 Ne. 17:40. the Lord hath redeemed his servant Jacob, 1 Ne. 20:20 (Isa. 48:20). let us go up to house of the God of Jacob, 2 Ne. 12:3 (Isa. 2:3). the Lord sent his word unto Jacob, and it hath lighted upon Israel, 2 Ne. 19:8. righteous shall sit down in kingdom of God with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob, Alma 5:24 (7:25; Hel. 3:30). remember words of Jacob before his death, Alma 46:24–26. father Jacob testified concerning remnant of seed of Joseph1, 3 Ne. 10:17. this people will Christ establish in this land unto fulfilling of covenant made with father Jacob, 3 Ne. 20:22.",
